  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">UK/RTP Custody and Detention Project (Phase 4)</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The project aims to improve police detention policy and practice in Thailand. Overall, improved custody and detention process will increase good practice, consistency and transparency of a suspect&#x2019;s detention. Any BNs subject to arrest will be handled properly at the pilot police station and in potential roll-out.</narrative>
  </description>
